cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "spinesurg-ct-nnunet: nnU-Net training pipeline for multi-class spine + pelvis CT segmentation"
abstract: >-
  nnU-Net v2 pipeline for 10-class segmentation of CT scans spanning the
  lumbar spine (L1-L6 including LSTV), sacrum, and bilateral hips, built on
  the CTSpinoPelvic1K dataset. Includes stratified 5-fold cross-validation,
  local-scratch-optimized preprocessing, LSTV oversampling, and a 6-ablation
  framework.
